"{\"blocks\":[{\"k\":\"t\",\"v\":\"I’d choose the Aeroplan award departing at noon if reaching Bangkok earlier and spending less time en route matter most. The tradeoff is that both awards require 65,000 Aeroplan points plus a quoted CAD 116.50 in taxes and fees, and the fee quote’s scope is unspecified; neither is a confirmed all-in total.\"},{\"k\":\"p\",\"r\":\"J7@2027-01-15T12:00-08:00/SFO>BKK/E>2027-01-17T01:25\",\"n\":\"Earlier-arriving Aeroplan award\",\"v\":\"Departs SFO Jan 15 at 12:00 and arrives BKK Jan 17 at 01:25 local, via TPE. The award is listed in economy, with one seat shown, 65,000 Aeroplan points and CAD 116.50 in quoted taxes and fees (scope unspecified). The itinerary has one stop and a 4h 30m connection at TPE; its elapsed time is 22h 25m. Leg-by-leg cabin details are not provided. Choose this over the later departure if an earlier Bangkok arrival is useful; it arrives 15h 25m earlier and takes 3h 55m less elapsed time than the other shown award. Downside: the midday departure is 11h 30m earlier, and the results do not establish the fee’s total scope.\"},{\"k\":\"x\",\"r\":\"T02\"},{\"k\":\"x\",\"r\":\"T03\"},{\"k\":\"a\",\"r\":\"J13@2027-01-15T23:30-08:00/SFO>BKK/E>2027-01-17T16:50\",\"n\":\"Later-departing Aeroplan award\",\"v\":\"Departs SFO Jan 15 at 23:30 and arrives BKK Jan 17 at 16:50 local, via TPE. It is also listed as an economy award with one seat shown, costing 65,000 Aeroplan points plus a quoted CAD 116.50 in taxes and fees, with scope unspecified. It has one stop and an 8h 15m TPE connection; elapsed time is 26h 20m. Leg-by-leg cabin details are not provided. Consider it if departing later is more important than arriving early. Compared with the noon award, it arrives 15h 25m later and takes 3h 55m longer.\"},{\"k\":\"x\",\"r\":\"T01\"},{\"k\":\"b\",\"r\":\"C1@2027-01-15T09:40-08:00/SFO>BKK\",\"n\":\"Cash-fare baseline\",\"v\":\"The shown Singapore Airlines cash itinerary departs SFO Jan 15 at 09:40 and arrives BKK Jan 17 at 08:25 local, with one stop via SIN. The quoted fare is USD 440 for one returned traveler; price scope is unspecified, so it should not be assumed to be an all-in or party total. This is a cash reference, not a like-for-like cost comparison with the awards: points and the award-fee quote have different, incompletely specified scopes.\"},{\"k\":\"t\",\"v\":\"These are selected search results, not a guarantee of current availability. Confirm seats and current prices with the booking provider before deciding. The search coverage was partial, so these shown choices do not establish the best option across all possible results.\"}]}"
